1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:01,611
Hi friends!

2
00:00:01,611 --> 00:00:03,601
Let's wash our hands!

3
00:00:04,151 --> 00:00:07,101
Clean hands keep us healthy!

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:12,101
First, turn on the water and wet your hands.

5
00:00:12,501 --> 00:00:14,676
Splash, splash!

6
00:00:16,376 --> 00:00:18,476
Then add some soap.

7
00:00:18,876 --> 00:00:20,751
Bubbly soap!

8
00:00:22,451 --> 00:00:23,766
Wash, wash,

9
00:00:23,766 --> 00:00:25,550
wash your hands!

10
00:00:25,851 --> 00:00:28,301
Scrub away the germs!

11
00:00:29,751 --> 00:00:31,929
Rub your hands together.

12
00:00:31,929 --> 00:00:33,301
Rub, rub, rub!

13
00:00:33,701 --> 00:00:36,375
Rub the fronts and backs!

14
00:00:38,075 --> 00:00:40,034
Wash between your fingers,

15
00:00:40,034 --> 00:00:41,925
and make lots of bubbles.

16
00:00:42,325 --> 00:00:44,500
So many bubbles!

17
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,515
Wash, wash,

18
00:00:47,515 --> 00:00:49,299
wash your hands!

19
00:00:49,599 --> 00:00:52,050
Scrub away the germs!

20
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,900
Rinse the bubbles away.

21
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:58,649
Bye bye, bubbles!

22
00:01:00,349 --> 00:01:02,849
Dry your hands with a towel.

23
00:01:03,249 --> 00:01:05,675
Pat, pat, all dry!

24
00:01:07,375 --> 00:01:09,650
When do we wash our hands?

25
00:01:10,050 --> 00:01:12,075
Before we eat!

26
00:01:13,775 --> 00:01:16,450
After we use the potty!

27
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,800
And after we play outside!

28
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:24,348
Now let's play a memory game!

29
00:01:24,898 --> 00:01:26,486
Do you remember?

30
00:01:26,486 --> 00:01:27,573
Let's see!

31
00:01:29,273 --> 00:01:31,173
What is this?

32
00:01:33,373 --> 00:01:34,949
Water!

33
00:01:35,499 --> 00:01:37,799
Yes! Well done!

34
00:01:39,499 --> 00:01:41,399
What is this?

35
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,923
Soap!

36
00:01:45,473 --> 00:01:47,423
That's right!

37
00:01:49,123 --> 00:01:51,023
What is this?

38
00:01:53,223 --> 00:01:54,823
Rub!

39
00:01:55,373 --> 00:01:57,398
Great job!

40
00:01:59,098 --> 00:02:00,998
What is this?

41
00:02:03,198 --> 00:02:04,848
Bubbles!

42
00:02:05,398 --> 00:02:07,373
You got it!

43
00:02:09,073 --> 00:02:10,973
What is this?

44
00:02:13,173 --> 00:02:14,748
Rinse!

45
00:02:15,298 --> 00:02:16,998
Super!

46
00:02:18,698 --> 00:02:20,598
What is this?

47
00:02:22,798 --> 00:02:24,297
Towel!

48
00:02:24,847 --> 00:02:26,497
Hooray!

49
00:02:28,197 --> 00:02:30,097
What is this?

50
00:02:32,297 --> 00:02:34,347
Before eating!

51
00:02:34,897 --> 00:02:37,197
Yes! Well done!

52
00:02:38,897 --> 00:02:40,797
What is this?

53
00:02:42,997 --> 00:02:45,221
After the potty!

54
00:02:45,771 --> 00:02:47,721
That's right!

55
00:02:49,421 --> 00:02:52,447
Wow! You remembered everything!

56
00:02:54,297 --> 00:02:56,947
You are a super learner!

57
00:02:58,647 --> 00:03:01,672
Look, my hands are squeaky clean!

58
00:03:02,222 --> 00:03:05,022
Great job, little learner!

59
00:03:05,572 --> 00:03:07,524
Share Mimzi with a friend,

60
00:03:07,524 --> 00:03:10,147
and subscribe for more learning fun!

61
00:03:10,697 --> 00:03:11,819
Next time,

62
00:03:11,819 --> 00:03:14,148
it's my bedtime routine.

63
00:03:14,398 --> 00:03:16,123
Bye bye!
